<section class="evidence" id="research"><div class="wrap"><header><p class="mono">EVIDENCE / BUILDING THE STACK</p><h2>Acquiring the stack.</h2><p>Current work and completed builds — separated from the proposed systems above.</p></header><div class="e-grid"><article class="hero-card"><span class="mono">01 / INTERVENTION · ACTIVE</span><h3>a-tbTUS + functional electrical stimulation</h3><p>Honours thesis at Krembil Brain Institute. Learning how the human nervous system responds to intervention.</p><div class="schematic"><b>a-tbTUS</b><i>→</i><b>MOTOR SYSTEM</b><i>←</i><b>FES</b></div></article><article><span class="mono">02 / SIGNALS</span><h3>Human DBS signal processing</h3><p>Working toward neural-state estimation from human electrophysiology.</p><div class="trace">∿∿∿∿∿∿∿∿</div></article><article><span class="mono">03 / CONTROL · BUILT</span><h3>Sense → compute → act</h3><p>IMU measurements mapped through a microcontroller to a two-axis servo system.</p><div class="schematic"><b>IMU</b><i>→</i><b>MCU</b><i>→</i><b>PAN/TILT</b></div></article></div><div class="model-card"><span class="mono">04 / MODELS · COMPLETED ANALYSIS</span><h3>Biomedical prediction under explicit validation.</h3><OperatingPoints/></div></div></section>
<style>.evidence{background:#efefe9;color:#111;padding:clamp(90px,11vw,150px) 0}.evidence header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 2fr;gap:20px 50px;margin-bottom:70px}.evidence header .mono,.e-grid .mono,.model-card>.mono{color:#666}.evidence header h2{font-size:clamp(48px,7vw,96px);letter-spacing:-.06em;line-height:.9}.evidence header>p:last-child{grid-column:2;color:#666}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid #bbb}.e-grid article{padding:30px 26px 42px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #bbb}.e-grid article+article{border-left:1px solid #bbb;padding-left:26px}.e-grid h3,.model-card h3{font-size:clamp(24px,2.7vw,40px);letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:20px 0 16px}.e-grid p{color:#555}.schematic{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:34px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px}.schematic i{font-style:normal;color:#777}.trace{font:30px var(--mono);overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;margin-top:36px}.model-card{margin-top:70px;padding-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #bbb}@media(max-width:850px){.evidence header,.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.evidence header>p:last-child{grid-column:auto}.e-grid article+article{border-left:0;padding-left:0}.model-card{overflow:hidden}}</style>
